"EN-US\"><span>--<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"> </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">only the boxplot for Case_A and\r\nCase_B (Source = O =observations)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:53.4pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Wingdings\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span>--<span style=\"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;\"></span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">, and only the jitter plot for\r\nCase_C and Case_D (Source = L = from literature).</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><img alt=\"\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Any\r\nsuggestions?</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Best\r\nwishes,</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">K.</span></p><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n</font></span></div></blockquote></div></div>"
